Use my authenticated school Chrome session and approved tools. Verify the signed-in school account: {{school_account}}
Infinite Campus: {{infinite_campus_url}}
Shared dashboard: {{dashboard_url}}
Agenda: {{agenda_url}}
Selected roster workbook: {{roster_workbook_url}}
Private assessment history: {{assessment_history_url}}
Use that exact history Sheet. It has Setup, Assessments, Item evidence, and Posting log tabs. Verify school ownership and Restricted access before writing. Do not create another history file or use the personal-account duplicate.
Read current Agenda instructions, Feedback Prompts including Prompt 1, and assignment-specific submission routing. Verify connector identity separately from browser identity. No IC admin API exists. Do not assume access to earlier chats, local files, GitHub, or another account's login.
If the scheduled runtime cannot access the authenticated school browser, stop affected work and report the concrete connection problem. Respect school restrictions and required product approvals.
